{"title":"Toronto Downtown Semi-formal Singles Mixer (Age 35 and under)","startsAt":"2026-10-09T20:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-09T23:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"NOTE: This is a paid event.\n\nTickets here: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/toronto-downtown-semi-formal-singles-mixer-age-35-and-under-tickets-1999224525373?aff=oddtdtcreator&keep_tld=true\n\nJoin us at the beautiful Spirit of York downtown Toronto for our semi-formal singles mixer. Dress to impress.\n\nCalling all Toronto singles! Join us for our biggest and best singles mixer. We got over 200 people out last time, so let's make this one even bigger!\n\nJoin us at the beautiful Spirit of York Distillery and meet a room full of singles at your leisure. Then pull up their profile on your phone, and give them a Like or a Pass. They will do the same for you, and matches are sent the following day.\n\nThe dress code is semi-formal for this event, so dress to impress! This one is for singlse aged 35 and under.\n\n**IMPORTANT:** Please create a profile on www.15FirstDates.ca using the same email you used on Eventbrite. You will need a profile if you'd like to participate in the in-person swiping. You do not need a profile to attend our event.\n\nThe mix and mingle will be from 8-10:30pm, followed by a DJ dance party.\n\nWe got over 200 guests last time downtown Toronto, so don't miss out!","venue":{"name":"Spirit of York Distillery Co.","address":"12 Trinity Street, Toronto","lat":43.65037,"lng":-79.359795,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Do Stuff and Make Friends in Toronto","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/d/d/c/6/highres_535916774.jpeg"}